Good catch — those two got lost in the detour. Let's create them now, same method as before.
.gitignore — controls what git tracks (keeps data/results/cruft out of version control):
bashcat > .gitignore << 'EOF'
# data & results (regenerable / third-party)
data/
results/

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# conda / venv
.conda/
env/
venv/

# os cruft
.DS_Store
EOF